      <p>The consulate is centrally located in the Chicago Loop, accessible from O'Hare and Midway airports. Applicants traveling from Ohio, Michigan, Wisconsin, or other distant states within the jurisdiction should plan their travel to align with their appointment and any same-day tasks (such as finalizing notarizations or translations).</p>

      <div class="msv__note">
