          <h3>Families, Remote Workers &amp; Early Retirees</h3>
          <p>Chicago and other Midwest cities have a growing community of remote workers and self-funded early retirees who want a higher quality of life in Europe. Applicants with investment portfolios, rental income from Midwest properties, or business sale proceeds are increasingly common at the Chicago consulate. Families with children are also well represented — Spain's education system and quality of life make it attractive for families seeking a European base.</p>
        </div>
