      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">Spain's cities — Barcelona, Madrid, Valencia, Seville, Bilbao — offer a quality of life that is genuinely transformative for Midwest residents accustomed to harsh winters. The NLV is the most straightforward legal route for Americans to live there full-time.</p>
