            <p>Illinois (or any other state) cannot apostille a federal document. Your FBI check must be sent to the US State Department Authentications Office in Washington D.C. Standard processing: 6–8 weeks. Use a private apostille service if you need it faster. Do not confuse this with your state's apostille service.</p>
